  Title: '<color=#FFD600>Luxury Lifestyle</color>'
  Details: '<color=white>You''re cordially invited, as a one of BitLife’s elite players, to indulge in the luxurious side of BitLife.\n\nGet the Luxury Lifestyle today! \n\n</color><color=#FFD600>What''s included:</color>'
